  "notes": [
    "Lost points at variable V:missing, which is neither in this file nor in a library it uses.",
    "Lost has a COLOR value CSS cannot hold: \"not a colour\".",
    "Feature/On is a boolean: CSS has no booleans, it is written as true or false.",
    "Ease/Spring is a spring easing (GENTLE): CSS has no springs, it is written as ease.",
    "Mode \"dark\" of Brand Colors would share the selector value \"dark\": it is \"dark-2\".",
    "--Accent is used but not in this output: it is in Library Colors (a library); add that collection to collections.",
    "Paint style Photo is image: CSS for it comes from a layer that uses it, and none read here does (an image has none).",
    "Effect style Frost holds no shadow: blurs are not tokens yet.",
    "Paint styles named White are 2 different styles: --White color(display-p3 1 1 1), --White-2 color(display-p3 0.98 0.98 0.98 / 0.8)."
  ]
